      "subtitle": "Set independent actuator for fiber bundle tension",
      "description": [
        "\"The positioning structure of the remanufactured joint is used, and the weaving rod ring and four-domain monitoring are added. The actuator is used for the main-level drive and fabric equipment to adjust the fiber bundle tension.\""
