      "subtitle": "Make maintenance isolation in the cooling section",
      "description": [
        "\"Expand the segmented flow paths and isolation joints on the mass fractionation heat exchange block and install them as cooling jackets. Each segment is provided with return flow, so that the weaving equipment can be arranged for segmented maintenance.\""
